              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "The \"West Bengal Transport Workers’ Social Security Scheme: Assistance for Purchase of Spectacles,\" introduced by the Labour Department of West Bengal, aims to improve eye health by providing a financial benefit of ₹500/- for purchasing spectacles. Beneficiaries can claim this assistance once every five years by submitting a valid prescription and proof of purchase."
                }
